    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d210-a4">

                <pb facs="1264" n="1106" xml:id="pg1106"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Affairs to Ambassador
                        Thompson</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-08"><hi rendition="#italic">January 8,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ambassador</hi>: Referring to my note of the 3d
                    instant, relative to the delivery of the American fishing vessels captured
                    within Mexican waters on account of poaching, I have the honor to inclose copy
                    of a communication received from the attorney-general of the Republic,
                    transmitting a telegram from the federal prosecuting attorney near the district
                    court of Veracruz, in which he states that the port master of said place has
                    already been directed to deliver the vessels to Mr. Frank P. Caballero.</p>
                <p>I renew, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Igno. Mariscal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
